  "description": "As part of the Ryobi ONE+ system of over 150 cordless tools for the home, garden, automotive, crafting and so much more, the Ryobi 18V ONE+ RCF18-0 10cm Clamp Fan offers a portable source of cooling air. This extremely compact and versatile ONE+ Clamp Fan can stand or attach onto almost anything such as a desk, workbench, pram, or bike, providing you with effective cooling wherever you are. Use it around your home and garden, in your workshop as you work on your next DIY project, the great outdoors when exploring or when you are on the move. Featuring a five-blade design gives you a strong air flow when on the max setting which will help keep you cool in the hottest of conditions. The rubberized clamp helps secure the fan onto any edge up to 38mm and any round object up to 25mm and the rotatable head helps direct air where needed. Equipped with a 10cm shroud diameter also means the fan can fit in tight spaces which gives you freedom knowing that you will be able to direct air flow anywhere you are. Use the two-speed switch to customise wind flow and runtime you need.",
